.env.*.local
# Recursive so nested secret files (e.g. docker/.env) are excluded from every
# build context, not just the repo root. Keep the committed .env.example.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
.git
.vscode
.idea
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
*.log
logs
tmp
temp
.claude
# #1115: the VL embedding shim is a Python tool, so following its README puts a
# multi-GB venv (mlx/torch wheels) inside the checkout. docker-compose.build.yml
# builds with `context: ..`, so without these the wheels are tarred up and
# streamed to the daemon on every local source build. Mirrors the .gitignore block.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.egg-info
